      "instance_name": "captain_james_t_kirk",
      "label": "Captain James T. Kirk",
      "description": "A fictional character from the Star Trek franchise, portrayed by actor William Shatner. He is the captain of the USS Enterprise in the original Star Trek series. He is often characterized as charismatic, bold, and action-oriented, which contrasts with Picard's more cerebral and diplomatic style. His popularity and the debate around him are central to the meme's context.",
