      "instance_name": "captain_jean_luc_picard",
      "label": "Captain Jean-Luc Picard",
      "description": "A fictional character from the Star Trek franchise, portrayed by actor Patrick Stewart. He is the captain of the USS Enterprise in the Next Generation series. He is often characterized as wise, diplomatic, and strategic. The debate over whether he or Kirk is 'better' is a long-standing fan discussion, making him a key reference point for the meme.",
